#ASSERT `the SI value of` 100 yard EQUALS 91.44
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 1 pound EQUALS 0.45359237
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 10 pound EQUALS 4.5359237
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 1 gallon EQUALS 4.54609
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 2 gallon EQUALS 9.09218
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 1 tahil EQUALS 37.799364
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 16 tahil EQUALS 604.789824
