#ASSERT `the SI value of` 100 kati EQUALS 60.479
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 1 chhun EQUALS 37.465
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 10 chhun EQUALS 374.65
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 1 chhek EQUALS 0.37465
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 2 chhek EQUALS 0.7493
#ASSERT `the SI value of` 0 yard EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the SI value of` 1 `another unit`
#ASSERT REFUSED `the SI value of` 1 metre
#ASSERT `exact row` yard
#ASSERT `exact row` pound
#ASSERT `approximate row` gallon
#ASSERT `approximate row` tahil
#ASSERT `approximate row` kati
#ASSERT `exact row` chhun
#ASSERT `exact row` chhek
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` yard EQUALS "metre"
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` pound EQUALS "kilogram"
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` tahil EQUALS "grams"
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` kati EQUALS "kilogram"
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` chhun EQUALS "millimetres"
#ASSERT `SI unit named for` chhek EQUALS "metre"
#ASSERT `the system of` yard EQUALS `an imperial standard of extension, weight or capacity`
#ASSERT `the system of` pound EQUALS `an imperial standard of extension, weight or capacity`
#ASSERT `the system of` gallon EQUALS `an imperial standard of extension, weight or capacity`
#ASSERT `the system of` tahil EQUALS `the local customary system of weights and measures`
