#ASSERT `the system of` chhek EQUALS `the local customary system of weights and measures`

§§ `s 4 — orders`

#ASSERT `an order within s 4` `good order`
#ASSERT NOT `an order within s 4` `unpublished order`
#ASSERT NOT `an order within s 4` `bad replacement order`

§§ `s 7 — saving`

